</p><p id="Par31">Data pertaining to the ICU stay following study inclusion, at ICU discharge, at study completion and results from univariable logistic regression with persistent IMW are presented in Table&#x000a0;<xref rid="Tab2" ref-type="table">2</xref> for the study population and the same subgroups.</p><p id="Par32">
